---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro'
import Address from '../components/Address.astro'
import { PAGES } from '../data/pages'
import { COMPANY } from '../data/company'
---

<Legal
  page={PAGES.refunds}
  h1="Refund and cancellation policy"
  intro="The Ferrocast app is free, so this policy only applies to Ferrocast Pro subscriptions, which are billed in Indian rupees through Razorpay."
>
  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <p>
    Pro is a digital service. It is activated on your Ferrocast account right after a successful
    payment, and you get a receipt by email. Nothing is shipped.
  </p>

  <h2>Cancelling</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      You can cancel Pro at any time from your account, or by emailing{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.billingEmail}`}>{COMPANY.billingEmail}</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Cancelling stops the next renewal. You keep Pro until the end of the period you already paid
      for.
    </li>
    <li>
      Nothing in the free app is affected. Your setup stays on your computer and keeps working.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Within 7 days of your first payment</strong> for a monthly or yearly plan, you can ask
      for a full refund for any reason.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Yearly plans after 7 days</strong>: if you cancel, we refund the unused whole months
      on request.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Charged by mistake</strong> (a renewal after you cancelled, or a double charge): we
      refund the full amount.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>If we shut down a Pro service</strong>, we refund any unused prepaid time without you
      having to ask.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Monthly renewals after the first 7 days are not refunded, but you can cancel so they don’t
    renew.
  </p>

  <h2>When Pro ends</h2>
  <p>
    Pro ends when a cancelled period runs out, when every renewal attempt fails, or when a payment
    is refunded. A refund ends Pro for the period it covers.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Cloud work, like the cloud bot and Ferrocast voices, stops within the hour.</li>
    <li>
      Your Pro data stays for 30 days, so you can still download your cloud backups and stream
      history. Then we delete it. A custom tip address is released after 7 days.
    </li>
    <li>The free app keeps working, with your setup on your computer.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The <a href="/privacy/#pro-data">privacy policy</a> lists what each Pro feature keeps and for
    how long.
  </p>

  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>
    Refunds go back to the original payment method through Razorpay. Once we approve a refund,
    Razorpay usually processes it within 5 to 7 working days; your bank or card issuer may take a
    few days more to show it. UPI refunds are often faster.
  </p>

  <h2>Tips are not covered here</h2>
  <p>
    Tips go straight from viewers to the streamer’s own payment account. We never receive tip money,
    so we cannot refund it. A viewer who wants a tip refunded should contact the streamer; streamers
    can refund through their payment provider.
  </p>

  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.billingEmail}`}>{COMPANY.billingEmail}</a> with the email on
    your account and the Razorpay payment id from your receipt. We reply within{' '}
    {COMPANY.responseDays} working days.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <Address />
</Legal>
